{
  "_readme": "Edit this file to change what the radar covers. To add an outlet: add it under 'outlets' (name, domain, optional feeds, optional note), then list its id in a group. A group's 'active' flag switches it on or off for scheduled runs. 'extra_outlets' are big general outlets: they are searched, and their feed items are only used when they match the group's 'keywords'. A 'note' like 'state-run' is shown to the AI so summaries say so. A group's 'balance' (regional beats only) asks for at least min_business business or economy stories and no more than max_same of any one type.",
